00:05:41.174 --> 00:05:43.468
You know, she's facing what is this?

00:05:43.468 --> 00:05:45.345
Who who are these people?

00:05:45.345 --> 00:05:46.387
They're not our people.

00:05:46.387 --> 00:05:48.306
They care more about money

00:05:48.306 --> 00:05:49.891
