00:05:49.891 --> 00:05:50.975
So it's a

00:05:50.975 --> 00:05:52.602
it's about a world in transition.

00:05:52.602 --> 00:05:54.270
And I think we're living in a world

00:05:54.270 --> 00:05:55.730
