00:05:55.730 --> 00:05:57.440
Some of you have been on massive

00:05:57.440 --> 00:05:59.108
hit HBO shows before.

00:05:59.108 --> 00:06:01.361
Some of you have amazing resumes.

00:06:01.361 --> 00:06:03.905
But this is the first major HBO hit.

00:06:03.905 --> 00:06:04.238
Mm hmm.

00:06:04.238 --> 00:06:05.573
I wonder if that informs

00:06:05.573 --> 00:06:07.075
the approach is the experience

00:06:07.075 --> 00:06:09.077
to those that have the

00:06:09.160 --> 00:06:10.453
ability to talk to those

00:06:10.453 --> 00:06:11.204
