00:06:35.478 --> 00:06:36.187
Like it's us.

00:06:36.187 --> 00:06:38.481
Like they really it's really us.

00:06:38.481 --> 00:06:40.566
And it feels

00:06:40.566 --> 00:06:42.527
it's just more special than I expected it

00:06:42.527 --> 00:06:45.696
to be that, but it just feels so claimed.

00:06:45.738 --> 00:06:47.407
I also get stopped by black women.

