done.

00:06:56.082 --> 00:06:57.667
The show really is extraordinary.

00:06:57.667 --> 00:06:58.501
Costumes, the set,

00:06:58.501 --> 00:06:59.544
the acting, the writing.

00:06:59.544 --> 00:07:00.878
I really appreciate you guys coming in.

00:07:00.878 --> 00:07:02.338
